<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan auctions six-month bonds in OMO.</title>
<headline>Pakistan auctions six-month bonds in OMO.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Wednesday it had auctioned six-month maturity short term federal bonds worth a total of one billion rupees in its weekly open market operation (OMO).</p>
<p>			  Offered	  Accepted	  Max. cut-off</p>
<p> Outright sale	1,550	    1,000	     15.80 pct</p>
<p> One-month	    nil		nil		 nil</p>
<p> Three-month	  nil		nil		 nil</p>
<p> Five-month	   800		nil		 nil</p>
<p> Total (million rupees )2,350	    1,000</p>
<p>($1 = 40.56 rupees) -- Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
